  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Elmhurst University is a private university in Elmhurst, Illinois. Originally established as the Elmhurst Proseminary in 1871, the University currently offers numerous undergraduate and graduate programs.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Elmhurst University offers a vibrant campus environment, with a diverse student body of approximately 3000 students. There are over 100 student organisations and clubs at the University. Numerous cultural events and support services are also available to make your student life even better.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The University provides several on-campus housing options with modern amenities. You can choose from their 6 residence halls, 14 university-owned houses or 2 apartment complexes. All options are located near the campus for easy commuting.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The A.C. Buehler Library on the campus has an extensive collection of books, journals, digital media, and study spaces.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>Elmhurst University has excellent athletic facilities, including a fitness centre, outdoor sports fields, and gymnasiums. The University also competes in NCAA Division III sports as the Bluejays, in basketball, soccer,= track and field, and more.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>The University is equipped with many state-of-the-art laboratories. Notable facilities include the Science Centre, which supports research in biology, chemistry, and physics.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>Whether you're craving a quick snack or a coffee, there are plenty of options you can choose from. Elmhurst University offers a variety of meal options catering to different dietary preferences, with a range of meal plans. You can also grab quick bites from eateries on the campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
